cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "Scientific Agent Skill Development and Validation Protocol"
abstract: >-
  A protocol that turns a research method into a documented, tested, citable agent skill:
  scoping the claim, grounding the method, generating the package, writing tests that can fail,
  recording the environment, auditing ethics and rights, validating structure, and preparing
  archival deposit without publishing autonomously.
type: software
